seq v=1 rig=screen program=claude build=2.1.0
# T1: the harness's `key act=approve`, admitted under the open box and
# accepted before the screen read that saw the box go: the box closes
# approved, by the harness (a proven author with an act).
see busy
half
see prompt bash:not-read-only fixture=claude-2.1.280-box-bash-touch
expect open p1 approval par=t1 box=bash:not-read-only at=500
admit harness act=approve
accept
at 750 see busy
expect close p1 approval out=approved by=harness at=750
